silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_01_higher_order_index_category_yoneda_hom_legs silm:hasExample "In 'HigherOrderIndexCategoryYonedaHomLegs', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the microchip_identifies arrow colim D_Mittens -> colim D_Pumpkin lives in the upper-level diagram and is preserved through the integration cocone; the integrated apex sees both cats as distinct individuals sharing one household registry.; also, Dr. Patel sees Mittens as a patient; sees_as_patient is a typed clinician-to-patient role arrow Vet77_apex -> colim D_Mittens, blocked from collapsing the vet onto the cat." .
